ropriate Clothing Attire (For all Genders \nin all Shifts/ Work Schedule) within office \npremises as observed by the Security Officers \nand/or Support Team Members. \nWritten \nWarning \nSuspension Dismissal \n26. Assault and physical battery against a fellow \nemployee \nDismissal \n \n \n27. Spreading untruthful, malicious, slanderous, \nand or libelous information against fellow \nemployees or the company. \nWritten \nWarning \nSuspension Dismissal \n28. Indecent or lewd act or conduct, or malicious \nsexual advances, or any similar act within \ncompany premises or which affects or disrupts \none’s or another’s work. \nDismissal \n \n \n29. Indecent, lewd, immoral utterances within \ncompany premises. \nDismissal \n \n \n30. Showing, exhibiting, posting or surfing \npornographic \nmaterials, \npictures, \nfilms, \nor \nliterature within company premises. \nDismissal \n \n \n31. Engaging in any immoral or unethical \npractices or offering services to customers or co-\nemployees \nwithin \ncompany \npremises \n(like \npimping, providing male and female companion, \nDismissal\nECENTERPRISES GROUP MANILA, INC. \nC&P Noel Bldg., Dr. V. Locsin St., \nDumaguete City, 6200, Negros Oriental \n \nwww.ececonsultinggroup.com \n \n \n54 \n \netc.) or engaging in any conduct which violates \ncommon decency or morality like illicit marital \naffairs, sexual exhibition, voyeurism, etc.\nECENTERPRISES GROUP MANILA, INC. \nC&P Noel Bldg., Dr. V. Locsin St., \nDumaguete City, 6200, Negros Oriental \n \nwww.ececonsultinggroup.com \n \n \n55 \n \n \nC. Provisions on Honesty \n \n1st \nOffense \n2nd \nOffense \n3rd \nOffense \n1. Embezzlement, \nmalversation \nand/or \nmisappropriation of Company funds or \nassets \nDismissal \n \n \n2. \nTheft of the company or other employee’s \nproperty \nDismissal \n \n \n3. \nUse of company or company\'s customers’ \ninformation for any purpose other than that which \nwas intended, or any personal purpose. \nDismissal \n \n \n4. \nSignificant m